error[RB0321]: `Login` has sensitive fields, and the initial value of `blob` is `json`
  --> main.road:11:20
   |
11 |   var blob: json = login
   |                    ^^^^^ a trace would show these fields
   |
   = help: traces redact a value by its type, and `json` has no fields to redact by: give `blob` the value's own type, or mark it `sensitive`

